      "section": "INTRODUCTION",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.99954133699995,
        "t": 633.42277681,
        "r": 540.0616875338999,
        "b": 564.5273449280328
      },
      "content": "The Hospira Plum A+ ®  infusion system is an advanced medication management system designed  to  meet  the  fluid  delivery  requirements  of  today's  evolving  healthcare environments.  With  its  primary  line,  secondary  line,  and  piggyback  fluid  delivery capabilities, the Plum A+ ®  is suited for a wide range of medical, surgical, and critical care applications.  Full  compatibility  with  LifeCare ®   Plum ®   Series  administration  sets  and accessories make the Plum A+ ®  a convenient and cost-effective infusion system."
    },
